        <title>Adding a Cron Job for Automatic TRIM in Proxmox VE</title>
        <link>https://gowinder.work/en/adding-a-cron-job-for-automatic-trim-in-proxmox-ve/</link>
        <pubDate>Fri, 17 Feb 2023 15:12:05 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://gowinder.work/en/adding-a-cron-job-for-automatic-trim-in-proxmox-ve/</guid>
        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;adding-a-cron-job-for-automatic-trim-in-proxmox-ve&#34;&gt;Adding a Cron Job for Automatic TRIM in Proxmox VE
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;check-the-status&#34;&gt;Check the status
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sudo systemctl status fstrim.timer
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# output:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;● fstrim.timer - Discard unused blocks once a week
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;     Loaded: loaded &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;/lib/systemd/system/fstrim.timer&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; disabled&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; vendor preset: enabled&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;     Active: inactive &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;dead&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    Trigger: n/a
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;   Triggers: ● fstrim.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;       Docs: man:fstrim
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;start-the-service&#34;&gt;Start the service
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sudo systemctl start fstrim.timer
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;check-the-next-cleanup-time&#34;&gt;Check the next cleanup time
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sudo systemctl list-timers --all
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# output:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;NEXT                        LEFT           LAST                        PASSED     UNIT                         ACTIVATES
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Fri 2023-02-17 23:54:54 CST 8h left        Thu 2023-02-16 23:54:54 CST 15h ago    systemd-tmpfiles-clean.timer systemd-tmpfiles-clean.servi&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Sat 2023-02-18 00:00:00 CST 8h left        Fri 2023-02-17 00:00:00 CST 15h ago    atop-rotate.timer            atop-rotate.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Sat 2023-02-18 00:00:00 CST 8h left        Fri 2023-02-17 00:00:00 CST 15h ago    logrotate.timer              logrotate.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Sat 2023-02-18 00:00:00 CST 8h left        Fri 2023-02-17 00:00:00 CST 15h ago    man-db.timer                 man-db.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Sat 2023-02-18 04:19:48 CST 13h left       Fri 2023-02-17 05:29:22 CST 9h ago     pve-daily-update.timer       pve-daily-update.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Sat 2023-02-18 05:18:55 CST 14h left       Fri 2023-02-17 06:45:48 CST 8h ago     apt-daily.timer              apt-daily.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Sat 2023-02-18 06:41:05 CST 15h left       Fri 2023-02-17 06:02:36 CST 9h ago     apt-daily-upgrade.timer      apt-daily-upgrade.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Sun 2023-02-19 03:10:12 CST &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; day 12h left Sun 2023-02-12 03:10:19 CST &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; days ago e2scrub_all.timer            e2scrub_all.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Mon 2023-02-20 00:37:59 CST &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; days left    n/a                         n/a        fstrim.timer                 fstrim.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;n/a                         n/a            n/a                         n/a        pvesr.timer
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Done&lt;/p&gt;</description>
        </item>
        <item>
        <title>Extending pvm-local Space in Proxmox VE</title>
        <link>https://gowinder.work/en/extending-pvm-local-space-in-proxmox-ve/</link>
        <pubDate>Fri, 17 Feb 2023 14:16:05 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://gowinder.work/en/extending-pvm-local-space-in-proxmox-ve/</guid>
        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;extending-pvm-local-space-in-proxmox-ve&#34;&gt;Extending pvm-local Space in Proxmox VE
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;reason&#34;&gt;Reason
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;proxmox ve&lt;/code&gt; I installed earlier on the &lt;code&gt;DIY E3&lt;/code&gt; server used a &lt;code&gt;120G&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;SSD&lt;/code&gt;. Back then, being young and naive, I also carved a &lt;code&gt;30g&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;data&lt;/code&gt; partition out of the &lt;code&gt;pve&lt;/code&gt; logical volume. Now I want to use &lt;code&gt;local&lt;/code&gt; for &lt;code&gt;glusterfs&lt;/code&gt;, so I wanted to merge the space in &lt;code&gt;data&lt;/code&gt; into &lt;code&gt;root&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;steps&#34;&gt;Steps
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;first-copy-out-the-contents-of-the-data-partition&#34;&gt;First, copy out the contents of the &lt;code&gt;data&lt;/code&gt; partition
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First delete what you don&amp;rsquo;t need on the &lt;code&gt;pve&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;webui&lt;/code&gt;; for what you do need, copy it out first. My &lt;code&gt;data&lt;/code&gt; is mounted at &lt;code&gt;/mnt/data&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sudo rsync -ar --info&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;progress2 /mnt/data/ /var/lib/vz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;After copying is done, remove the &lt;code&gt;data&lt;/code&gt; logical volume:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sudo umount /mnt/data
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sudo lvdisplay
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a look at the result:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;16
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; --- Logical volume ---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  LV Path                /dev/pve/data
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  LV Name                data
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  VG Name                pve
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  LV UUID                xxxx
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  LV Write Access        read/write
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  LV Creation host, &lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;time&lt;/span&gt; pve, 2020-12-13 12:19:01 +0800
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  LV Status              available
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# open                 0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  LV Size                30.39 GiB
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Current LE             &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;7781&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Segments               &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Allocation             inherit
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Read ahead sectors     auto
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  - currently &lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;set&lt;/span&gt; to     &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;256&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Block device           253:2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove it:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sudo lvremove pve/data
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Logical volume &amp;#34;data&amp;#34; successfully removed&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check the &lt;code&gt;vg&lt;/code&gt; space with &lt;code&gt;sudo vgdisplay&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;16
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;17
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;18
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;19
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;20
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  --- Volume group ---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  VG Name               pve
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  System ID
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Format                lvm2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Metadata Areas        &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Metadata Sequence No  &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;73&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  VG Access             read/write
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  VG Status             resizable
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  MAX LV                &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Cur LV                &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Open LV               &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Max PV                &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Cur PV                &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Act PV                &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  VG Size               &amp;lt;106.60 GiB
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  PE Size               4.00 MiB
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Total PE              &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;27289&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Alloc PE / Size       &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;19508&lt;/span&gt; / 76.20 GiB
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Free  PE / Size       &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;7781&lt;/span&gt; / 30.39 GiB
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  VG UUID               xxxx
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As you can see, there is &lt;code&gt;30.39 Gib&lt;/code&gt; of space. Now merge it into &lt;code&gt;pve-root&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;sudo lvresize -l +100%FREE /dev/pve/root&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Size of logical volume pve/root changed from 72.70 GiB &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;18612&lt;/span&gt; extents&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; to &amp;lt;103.10 GiB &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;26393&lt;/span&gt; extents&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  Logical volume pve/root successfully resized.&lt;span class=&#34;sb&#34;&gt;`&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It becomes &lt;code&gt;103.10 GiB&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
        </item>
        <item>
        <title>Drastic Disk Performance Drop Caused by NVMe Power Management in Proxmox VE</title>
        <link>https://gowinder.work/en/drastic-disk-performance-drop-caused-by-nvme-power-management-in-proxmox-ve/</link>
        <pubDate>Fri, 17 Feb 2023 10:25:05 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://gowinder.work/en/drastic-disk-performance-drop-caused-by-nvme-power-management-in-proxmox-ve/</guid>
        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;drastic-disk-performance-drop-caused-by-nvme-power-management-in-proxmox-ve&#34;&gt;Drastic Disk Performance Drop Caused by NVMe Power Management in Proxmox VE
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;A few days ago I deployed a two-node &lt;code&gt;proxmox ve&lt;/code&gt; cluster. It worked fine at first, but after a day, when I logged in to the &lt;code&gt;dell r720&lt;/code&gt; host over &lt;code&gt;ssh&lt;/code&gt;, I found the &lt;code&gt;shell&lt;/code&gt; responding very slowly, and going into the &lt;code&gt;linux container&lt;/code&gt; on it was even worse — every time I typed a command, &lt;code&gt;zsh&lt;/code&gt; would freeze for quite a while.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
        </item>
        <item>
        <title>Rebuilding a GlusterFS Volume</title>
        <link>https://gowinder.work/en/rebuilding-a-glusterfs-volume/</link>
        <pubDate>Thu, 16 Feb 2023 10:53:05 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://gowinder.work/en/rebuilding-a-glusterfs-volume/</guid>
        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;rebuilding-a-glusterfs-volume&#34;&gt;Rebuilding a GlusterFS Volume
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;background&#34;&gt;Background
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;When I first set up the &lt;code&gt;glusterfs&lt;/code&gt; cluster I was in a hurry and used the network addresses of the &lt;code&gt;pve&lt;/code&gt; hosts directly. After a few days I noticed that when &lt;code&gt;volume&lt;/code&gt; replication ran it was saturating the &lt;code&gt;pve&lt;/code&gt; hosts&amp;rsquo; own network channel. The &lt;code&gt;dell r720&lt;/code&gt; happened to have four NICs and the &lt;code&gt;e3&lt;/code&gt; host had two, so I took one from each and dedicated it as the &lt;code&gt;gluster&lt;/code&gt; bind address.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
        </item>
        <item>
        <title>Mounting a Physical Disk to a Proxmox VE VM</title>
        <link>https://gowinder.work/en/mounting-a-physical-disk-to-a-proxmox-ve-vm/</link>
        <pubDate>Tue, 14 Feb 2023 09:39:05 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://gowinder.work/en/mounting-a-physical-disk-to-a-proxmox-ve-vm/</guid>
        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;mounting-a-physical-disk-to-a-proxmox-ve-vm&#34;&gt;Mounting a Physical Disk to a Proxmox VE VM
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;First, find the &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; of the disk you want to mount:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;lsblk &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;awk &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;NR==1{print $0&amp;#34; DEVICE-ID(S)&amp;#34;}NR&amp;gt;1{dev=$1;printf $0&amp;#34; &amp;#34;;system(&amp;#34;find /dev/disk/by-id -lname \&amp;#34;*&amp;#34;dev&amp;#34;\&amp;#34; -printf \&amp;#34; %p\&amp;#34;&amp;#34;);print &amp;#34;&amp;#34;;}&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;grep -v -E &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;part|lvm&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The output looks similar to this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;NAME         MAJ:MIN RM   SIZE RO TYPE MOUNTPOINT DEVICE-ID&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;S&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;loop0          7:0    &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;    20G  &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; loop
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;loop1          7:1    &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;    80G  &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; loop
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;loop2          7:2    &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;    50G  &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; loop
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sda            8:0    &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;   3.6T  &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; disk   /dev/disk/by-id/ata-WDC_WD40EJRX-XXXXXXX_WD-WWWWW0XXXXXX /dev/disk/by-id/wwn-0x5000000000000
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;For example, to mount &lt;code&gt;/dev/disk/by-id/wwn-0x5000000000000&lt;/code&gt; for a &lt;code&gt;VM&lt;/code&gt; whose ID is &lt;code&gt;103&lt;/code&gt;, run the following:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
        </item>
        <item>
        <title>Resolving Gluster Brick Offline Issues</title>
        <link>https://gowinder.work/en/resolving-gluster-brick-offline-issues/</link>
        <pubDate>Sat, 11 Feb 2023 21:13:05 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://gowinder.work/en/resolving-gluster-brick-offline-issues/</guid>
        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;resolving-gluster-brick-offline-issues&#34;&gt;Resolving Gluster Brick Offline Issues
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;offline-issue&#34;&gt;Offline Issue
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;I had just finished installing &lt;code&gt;gluster&lt;/code&gt; and stored the &lt;code&gt;rootfs&lt;/code&gt; of a &lt;code&gt;linux container&lt;/code&gt; on it, so that the &lt;code&gt;linux container&lt;/code&gt; could achieve high availability within a two-node &lt;code&gt;pve&lt;/code&gt; cluster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When I had some spare time, I checked with the command: &lt;code&gt;sudo gluster vol status VMS&lt;/code&gt;, and found that one &lt;code&gt;brick&lt;/code&gt; was in &lt;code&gt;offline&lt;/code&gt; state.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I looked it up online and installed &lt;code&gt;gstatus&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
        </item>
        <item>
        <title>Notes on Deploying a Two-Node HA Cluster and GlusterFS Distributed File System on Proxmox VE</title>
        <link>https://gowinder.work/en/deploying-a-two-node-ha-cluster-and-glusterfs-distributed-file-system-on-proxmox-ve/</link>
        <pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2023 14:14:05 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://gowinder.work/en/deploying-a-two-node-ha-cluster-and-glusterfs-distributed-file-system-on-proxmox-ve/</guid>
        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;deploying-a-two-node-ha-cluster-and-glusterfs-distributed-file-system-on-proxmox-ve&#34;&gt;Deploying a Two-Node HA Cluster and GlusterFS Distributed File System on Proxmox VE
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make sure both pve nodes run the same version&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two &lt;code&gt;proxmox ve&lt;/code&gt; nodes, enabling high availability with automatic &lt;code&gt;vm&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;lxc&lt;/code&gt; migration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;edit-the-hosts-file&#34;&gt;Edit the &lt;code&gt;hosts&lt;/code&gt; file
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In &lt;code&gt;/etc/hosts&lt;/code&gt; on both &lt;code&gt;pve&lt;/code&gt; machines, add the following &lt;code&gt;host&lt;/code&gt; entries:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-text&#34; data-lang=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;192.168.1.229 pve1.local pve1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;192.168.1.230 pve2.local pve2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;192.168.1.229 gluster1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;192.168.1.230 gluster2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;install-glusterfs&#34;&gt;Install &lt;code&gt;glusterfs&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The following operations are performed on both machines, referred to here as &lt;code&gt;pve1&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;pve2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
        </item>
        
